<code data-path-to-node=3D"4,0,0" data-index-in-node=3D"29">body</code> tag=
 in the CSS. Right now it uses a dark linear gradient (<code data-path-to-n=
ode=3D"4,0,0" data-index-in-node=3D"92">background: linear-gradient(...)</c=
ode>). You can change this to a solid color, a different gradient, or even =
an image.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=3D"4,1,0"><b data-path-to-node=
=3D"4,1,0" data-index-in-node=3D"0">The Main Card:</b> Find the <code data-=
